    "summary": "Use it in your Movement or Charge phase on up to 2 **WAR DOG** units of yours or 1 **TITANIC CHAOS KNIGHTS** unit of yours. For the rest of the phase, on each Charge, Fall Back, Advance or **Normal move** made by a model from 1 of those units:\n\n- it may pass over models and **terrain features**\n- it may enter **Engagement Range** of those models, but may finish there only on a **Charge move**\n- it passes any **Desperate Escape** test automatically\n\nIgnore the **[Super-heavy Walker](vsdata:core-ability/super-heavy-walker)** ability while using this Stratagem.",
